We  can turn all $G[V_i]$ into monochromatic cliques with
    the loop color of $E$ by recoloring at most

    \begin{equation*}
        \frac{r}{3}(p(\hat K_3,G)-\varsigma_n)\binom{n}{2}

    \end{equation*}

    edges.

